/ActualText (    The mineral reserves estimation project utilizing SURPAC software has proven to be an invaluable asset in the mining industry, significantly enhancing the accuracy, efficiency, and reliability of reserves assessments. The importance of reserves estimation cannot be overstated, as it plays a pivotal role in various stages of mining operations, from initial exploration to mine planning and resource optimization.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
